            "sid": "EZK 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seeri lafaa, ka moga mirga, Baariini Gudda iraa bahe, ila boru qajeele, Dira Hethlonitifi kara Hamathitifi dira Enonitifi seera lafa Damaskiti, ta Hamathi jiddu bahuni, baha. Gochiti ch'ufti abbu qooda lafaa toko argachuu male. Lafa worraa qoodani suni seeri isii gama ila boruti bahe ila adu qajeele, Baariini Guddati eja. Gochiti ch'ufti qooda lafa mirgaa fuute, bitaati d'aabde, akanaani wolgula argachuu malte:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.1+EZK.48.2+EZK.48.3+EZK.48.4+EZK.48.5+EZK.48.6+EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.1",
              "EZK.48.2",
              "EZK.48.3",
              "EZK.48.4",
              "EZK.48.5",
              "EZK.48.6",
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qooda lafa ta koba baasani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
