            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.1+EZK.48.2+EZK.48.3+EZK.48.4+EZK.48.5+EZK.48.6+EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.1",
              "EZK.48.2",
              "EZK.48.3",
              "EZK.48.4",
              "EZK.48.5",
              "EZK.48.6",
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qooda lafa ka lafa Yudati aanu huji jabdu koba kayuu malani. Ballinni qooda suni, ka mirgaa bahe bitaati eju ejata kuma kud'ani lamatifi d'ibba shani. Ammalle d'eerinni isaaleeni, ka ilaboruti bahe ila aduti eju, qooda lafa ka gosa kennaniini qit'e taka. Mana Waaqa qooda kana keesati jaarani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qooda lafaa kana jiddu keesa lafa toko, ta d'eerinni isii ejata kuma kud'ani lamafi d'ibi shani, ta ballinnileeni kuma kud'ani, AABBO Waaqa koba baasuu malani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa qulqullo tana keesa qaaloleeni qooda ufi argachuu malte. Biimani qooda worraa, ta ilaboruti baate ila aduti ejitu, ejata kuma kud'ani lamafi d'ibba shani. Biimani isaa ta mirgaa baate bitaati ejitu, ejata kuma shani. Mana AABBO Waaqa lafa tana wod'akati jaaru malani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti qulqullooni tunini ta qaalole d'aloota Sadoki. Worri sunini worra Israeli ka ch'ubbu tolche kaani gula imbaane, yokhaani worra Lawi, ka akasuma ch'ubbu tolchele, gula imbaane, ammo huji tiyya guute. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi worri qooda toko koba argachu male. Qoodi sunini d'aatu qooda worra Lawi jira, ammalle qooda qooda ch'ufa ira qulqullo tahu male. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri gosa Lawileni qooda lafaa koba qabaachuu male. Qoodi sunini qooda qaalole moga bitaa jiraachu male; mogaani isaa ta ilaboruti baate ilaaduti ejitu, d'eerinni isii ejata kuma kud'ani lamatifi d'ibba shani. Mogaani isaa, ta mirgaa baate bitaati ejitu, ejata kuma shani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoodi lafaa, ka AABBO Waaqa oli kayani, qooda lafaa kaani ch'ufa ira dansa. Qooda kana tokole ingurgurani, yokhaani injijirani, yokhaani nama d'ibile indabarsani. Qoodi kunini qulqullo ammalle ka AABBO Waaqati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoodi lafaa, ka qooda suni iraa hafe, ka d'eerinni isaa ejata kuma kud'ani lamatifi d'ibba shani, ka ballinnileeni ejata kuma lamafi d'ibba shani, qulqullooniti ammo taatule ka gumi ch'ufati; worrati mana iti jaarateate lafa horini oolule tolfata. Dira wod'aka isaa suni keesati jaaruu malani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ballinafi d'eerinni isaaleeni ch'ufti ejata kuma lamafi d'ibba lamafi shantamati; gami isaa ch'ufti wolqit'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dira suni moga isaa ch'ufa, diida lafati jira, ka d'eerinni isaa ejata d'ibbafi diddami shani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa, dira suni ka bitaa lafa qulqullooti jaarani iraa hafte, nama dira suniti lafa oobru tolfate liqimsa keesaa argata. Biimani lafa suni ta ilaborutifi ta ila aduleni haguma takaa d'eerinni ejata kuma shaniti, ballinnileeni ejata kuma lamafi d'ibba shani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami dira suni keesati galu ch'ufti, ato gosa fed'e tahele lafa suni inuma qotata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akanaani lafti, qooda lafa ka kobaa baasani kaani jiddu keesa jirtu, mogaani isii ch'ufti wolqit'e, biimani isii, ta moga ch'ufaa, ejata kuma kud'ani lamafi d'ibba shani. Ammalle lafti dira irati jaaranileeni qooduma suni keesaa jirti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qooda lafa ka Mana Waaqatifi lafa qaaloleetifi lafa worra Lawitifi diri keesa jiru, moga ilaborutifi ta ila adule, lafa ira hafteti jira, ta hayyu kennani. Lafti hayyu kennani sunini moga ilaborutini seera lafa ilaboruti ejiti, moga ilaadutini baariini guddati ejiti; ammalle moga isii, ta mirgaa, qooda lafa Yudati iti eja. Gama bitaatini qooda laafa Benjaminiti iti eja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21+EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21",
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lafa gosa Israeli taani d'ibii kennani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
