          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qooda lafaa kaaniini gama bita, gochiti hafte taani ch'ufti abbu qooda lafaa toko argachu malte. Lafti sunini seera lafa taani ila boru iraa baate, ila adu qajeelte, Baariini Guddati ejiti. Gochiti ch'ufti qooda lafaa mirgaa fuute, bitaati d'aabde, akanaani wolgula argachu malte:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.23+EZK.48.24+EZK.48.25+EZK.48.26+EZK.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
