              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biimani naabo suni, ta moga afraani ch'ufti wolti, ejata kuma sagali. Armaa achi maqaani dira kana baasani AABBO Waaqi Arma Jira!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
